          <groundspeak:finder id="3343813">chevyragtop</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP491 Edgerton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First visit to this sleepy small town. A quick find on a very warm sunny day. Since the brewery ( yes there is a brewery in town ) was closed today we moved on. Thanks for another BC.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
