          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP491 Edgerton&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7:39am It was a very foggy morning - and the spider webs in the shrubs and tall grass stood out against the grey background.  No problem reading the numbers on this cap.  TFTC!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
