          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP491 Edgerton - It was a foggy morning as we headed east from Wainwright to Edgerton ... another place where but for a cap we would have never ventured.  Downtown Edgerton was quiet and serene on this early Sunday morning.  TFTCap&lt;/p&gt;

